Error [E0507]: While the loop is reading `nums`, nothing may change it
  --> tests/ui/list_loop_mutate.jet:3:23
    |
  3 |     loop x in nums -> nums.push(3)
    |                       ^^^^
 Why: The loop reads `nums` across its body, so `nums.push()` changes the collection being visited
 Fix: Choose the collection intent explicitly instead of changing `nums` with `nums.push()`: collect a separate result when the original traversal should stay unchanged; snapshot `nums` before the loop when only original values belong in the traversal; or use an explicit work queue when newly added values should be visited
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0507
